<title>CHINA: Pakistan President Farooq Leghari to visit China.</title>
<headline>Pakistan President Farooq Leghari to visit China.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani President Farooq Khan Leghari will make a working visit to China later this month, a Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Leghari would be in China from April 29 to 30 at the invitation of his Chinese counterpart Jiang Zemin, spokesman Cui Tiankai told a news briefing in Beijing.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
</text>
